                        "text": "{\"analysis\":{\"summary\":\"两条告警分别记录rundll32 MiniDump与7z打包进程启动，同主机同用户，时间接近；授权、文件落地与外传均未证实。\",\"members\":[{\"alert_id\":\"ec1d665d-46ff-57d5-a549-1ff006e66b26\",\"state\":\"analyzed\",\"summary\":\"7z.exe以operator-0在目标主机启动，命令行打包lsass.dmp为stage.7z，父进程cmd.exe，action成功。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"N2_S29\",\"N2_S33\",\"N2_S36\",\"N2_S39\",\"N2_S42\",\"N2_S45\",\"N2_S48\",\"N2_S51\",\"N2_S54\",\"N2_S69\"],\"limitations\":[\"仅进程启动字段，未证文件实际生成\",\"无授权与基线信息\"]},{\"alert_id\":\"f2696a2f-5b1a-5373-a5fa-e69459eae75e\",\"state\":\"analyzed\",\"summary\":\"rundll32.exe以operator-0启动，命令行调用comsvcs.dll MiniDump转储PID 688至lsass.dmp，父进程cmd.exe，action成功。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"N2_S56\",\"N2_S58\",\"N2_S59\",\"N2_S60\",\"N2_S61\",\"N2_S62\",\"N2_S63\",\"N2_S64\",\"N2_S65\",\"N2_S70\"],\"limitations\":[\"未证转储文件落地或内容\",\"无授权与基线信息\"]}],\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"F1\",\"state\":\"observed\",\"statement\":\"两告警均记录operator-0在local-eval-20261105-02-host上由cmd.exe派生的进程启动，命令行分别指向lsass转储与stage.7z打包。\",\"alert_ids\":[\"ec1d665d-46ff-57d5-a549-1ff006e66b26\",\"f2696a2f-5b1a-5373-a5fa-e69459eae75e\"],\"support_ids\":[\"N2_S36\",\"N2_S42\",\"N2_S45\",\"N2_S48\",\"N2_S59\",\"N2_S61\",\"N2_S62\",\"N2_S63\"],\"counter_ids\":[],\"alternatives\":[\"管理员授权的凭据转储演练\",\"合法运维打包\"],\"limitations\":[\"命令行相同不等于同一执行实例\",\"无授权记录\"]},{\"id\":\"F2\",\"state\":\"unresolved\",\"statement\":\"进程活动查询仅部分可见，未取得lsass.dmp落地、stage.7z生成或进程链完整证据；网络查询无行，不能证明无外传。\",\"alert_ids\":[\"ec1d665d-46ff-57d5-a549-1ff006e66b26\",\"f2696a2f-5b1a-5373-a5fa-e69459eae75e\"],\"support_ids\":[\"N2_S1\",\"N2_S2\"],\"counter_ids\":[],\"alternatives\":[\"文件已生成但未被查询覆盖\",\"无外传连接\"],\"limitations\":[\"查询视图部分/空结果非反证\",\"采集完整性未知\"]}],\"questions\":[{\"id\":\"detection_facts\",\"state\":\"answered\",\"answer\":\"记录显示两进程启动：rundll32 MiniDump写lsass.dmp，7z打包stage.7z；对象为主机、operator-0、cmd.exe父进程。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"N2_S36\",\"N2_S42\",\"N2_S45\",\"N2_S48\",\"N2_S59\",\"N2_S61\",\"N2_S62\",\"N2_S63\"],\"limitations\":[\"仅进程启动字段\"]},{\"id\":\"member_relationships\",\"state\":\"unresolved\",\"answer\":\"两告警同主机同用户、命令行前后衔接，提示可能同一操作链，但无共享进程ID或文件事件证实因果。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"N2_S36\",\"N2_S59\",\"N2_S69\",\"N2_S70\"],\"limitations\":[\"时间接近与图可达不构成因果\"]},{\"id\":\"behavior_nature\",\"state\":\"unresolved\",\"answer\":\"命令行符合凭据转储与打包特征，但无授权、基线或演练记录，不能定性恶意或正常。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"N2_S36\",\"N2_S59\"],\"limitations\":[\"标签不证明良性或恶意\"]},{\"id\":\"authorization\",\"state\":\"unresolved\",\"answer\":\"未提供任何审批或授权记录；未提供审批不等于无审批。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"N2_S45\",\"N2_S62\"],\"limitations\":[\"无授权来源\"]},{\"id\":\"impact\",\"state\":\"unresolved\",\"answer\":\"仅观察到进程启动成功；文件落地、凭据泄露与外传均未证实，网络查询空不构成反证。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"N2_S1\",\"N2_S2\",\"N2_S54\",\"N2_S65\"],\"limitations\":[\"查询部分可见\",\"空结果非反证\"]},{\"id\":\"coverage\",\"state\":\"unresolved\",\"answer\":\"两成员均有观察但文件与网络证据缺口；历史、知识未查，图源未接通，威胁情报不适用。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"N2_S1\",\"N2_S2\"],\"limitations\":[\"预算与连接限制\"]}],\"domains\":[{\"name\":\"identity\",\"applicability\":\"applicable\",\"reason\":\"涉及operator-0账户执行敏感进程，但无认证、MFA、会话与权限记录。\",\"alert_ids\":[\"ec1d665d-46ff-57d5-a549-1ff006e66b26\",\"f2696a2f-5b1a-5373-a5fa-e69459eae75e\"],\"finding_ids\":[\"F1\"],\"limitations\":[\"无身份认证与会话证据\"]},{\"name\":\"cloud\",\"applicability\":\"not_applicable\",\"reason\":\"证据均为本地主机进程，无云控制面、IAM或配置事件。\",\"alert_ids\":[],\"finding_ids\":[],\"limitations\":[\"未提供云侧数据\"]},{\"name\":\"phishing\",\"applicability\":\"not_applicable\",\"reason\":\"无邮件、链接、附件或投递点击记录。\",\"alert_ids\":[],\"finding_ids\":[],\"limitations\":[\"未提供邮件数据\"]},{\"name\":\"insider\",\"applicability\":\"undetermined\",\"reason\":\"operator-0执行转储与打包，但数据访问量、外传目的地与基线授权均缺。\",\"alert_ids\":[\"ec1d665d-46ff-57d5-a549-1ff006e66b26\",\"f2696a2f-5b1a-5373-a5fa-e69459eae75e\"],\"finding_ids\":[\"F1\",\"F2\"],\"limitations\":[\"无外传与基线证据\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"followups\":[{\"question_id\":\"impact\",\"alert_ids\":[\"ec1d665d-46ff-57d5-a549-1ff006e66b26\",\"f2696a2f-5b1a-5373-a5fa-e69459eae75e\"],\"mode\":\"deep\",\"objective\":\"核实lsass.dmp与stage.7z是否落地及后续外传。\",\"required_evidence\":\"文件写入事件、外传连接目的地址\",\"source_ids\":[\"N2_S1\",\"N2_S2\"],\"object_keys\":[\"[\\\"host\\\",\\\"local-eval-20261105-02-host\\\"]\",\"[\\\"user\\\",\\\"operator-0\\\"]\"]}]},\"conclusion\":{\"text\":\"两告警显示operator-0在目标主机执行lsass转储与打包进程，行为敏感但授权、文件落地与外传未证实，暂不能定性。\",\"state\":\"uncertain\",\"alert_ids\":[\"ec1d665d-46ff-57d5-a549-1ff006e66b26\",\"f2696a2f-5b1a-5373-a5fa-e69459eae75e\"],\"support_ids\":[\"N2_S36\",\"N2_S59\",\"N2_S45\",\"N2_S62\"],\"limitations\":[\"仅进程启动字段\",\"查询部分可见\",\"无授权记录\"]},\"closing_note\":\"已汇总两成员进程启动事实；文件落地、外传与授权仍待核，空查询不作反证。\",\"comparison\":{\"kind\":\"initial\",\"summary\":null,\"support_ids\":[]},\"impact\":{\"summary\":\"仅确认两进程启动成功；无文件落地、凭据泄露或外传的确定变化。\",\"alert_ids\":[\"ec1d665d-46ff-57d5-a549-1ff006e66b26\",\"f2696a2f-5b1a-5373-a5fa-e69459eae75e\"],\"support_ids\":[\"N2_S54\",\"N2_S65\"],\"supported_changes\":[],\"cannot_generalize\":[\"进程启动成功不等于转储完成或数据外传\",\"空网络查询不能推广为无外传\"],\"next_steps\":[\"补查文件写入与外传连接\"]},\"recommendations\":[{\"id\":\"R1\",\"action_type\":\"investigate\",\"object_keys\":[\"[\\\"host\\\",\\\"local-eval-20261105-02-host\\\"]\",\"[\\\"user\\\",\\\"operator-0\\\"]\"],\"reason\":\"核实转储文件落地、外传目的地与操作授权。\",\"source_ids\":[\"N2_S1\",\"N2_S2\",\"N2_S36\",\"N2_S59\"],\"limitations\":[\"不声称已审批或执行\"]}]}",
